{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/vernissageserver\/registeroauthclientrequestdto"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Vernissage"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto"}],"externalID":"s:16VernissageServer29RegisterOAuthClientRequestDtoV","title":"RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OAuth dynamic client registration metadata (RFC 7591)."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Registered clients have a set of metadata values associated with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their client identifier at an authorization server, such as the list","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of valid redirection URIs or a display name.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"These client metadata values are used in two ways:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"as input values to registration requests, and"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"as output values in registration responses."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following client metadata fields are defined by this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specification.  The implementation and use of all client metadata","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fields is OPTIONAL, unless stated otherwise.  All data member types","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(strings, arrays, numbers) are defined in terms of their JSON","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[RFC7159] representations.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/init(redirectUris:tokenEndpointAuthMethod:grantTypes:responseTypes:clientName:clientUri:logoUri:scope:contacts:tosUri:policyUri:jwksUri:jwks:softwareId:softwareVersion:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/clientName","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/clientUri","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/contacts","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/grantTypes","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/jwks","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/jwksUri","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/logoUri","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/policyUri","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/redirectUris","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/RegisterOAuthClientRequestDto\/responseTypes","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\